WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.980
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the World Champion, Dande…

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.110
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew…

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.390
This is the story of their lives and adventures.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:21.790
Nice!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.580
All right! I caught Koratta!

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.590
You did it, Go!

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:37.350
Koratta’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.920
I can’t wait for the film shoot!

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.030
And the director is
the world-famous Koreda!

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:46.360
It’s a story about Sirknight twins, right?

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:46.860
Yeah!

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.800
The elder sister is played
by a real Sirknight,

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.360
but the younger one is apparently played
by a transformed Metamon!

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.780
Don’t overthink it.
You’ll do just fine.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.000
This isn’t it!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.470
Who?! Who left this
unnecessary stuff here?!

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.340
Sorry! We’ll get it out of here!

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.930
Hello!

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:17.080
Welcome. Director Sakuragi
told me about you.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.500
Thank you for having us.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.720
What’s even the <i>point</i>
in talking to you?!

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:24.350
I, a star actress, am saying
I’ll be in your movie!

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.260
Get me the director, now!

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.130
We’re in the middle of filming...

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.730
Hey, hold on!
What are you doing?!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:32.840
I just want to
meet Sirknight, meow!

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.100
Sirknight!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.240
Oh, for crying out loud...

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.550
It’s obvious that you can’t!

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.260
Obviously...

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:42.830
We’re starting.

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:47.080
Ready... Action!

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:59.100
There are two Sirknight...
This is a dream, meow!

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.360
One was fake, meow...

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.530
Cut! This isn’t it!

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.450
Another retake, huh?

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:25.410
Metamon! Transform Pokémon!
Normal type!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.870
Capable of reorganizing its cells...

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:32.120
...to transform into an exact duplicate
of any Pokémon!

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.060
“Exact”, it says...

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:37.050
Metamon has been
slipping up a lot lately.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.300
This isn’t it!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.780
This isn’t what I’m looking for!

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.890
If you really can’t
turn <i>this</i> into <i>it</i>, then...

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.310
Go... Do <i>that!</i>

00:02:53.780 --> 00:03:00.410
PocketMonsters

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.830
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:05.410
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.130
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:11.000
And skip the slow send-off

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.340
Be it through fire or through water

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:16.010
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:20.510
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:25.770
Each and every one of my memories

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:30.360
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.280
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:40.030
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:47.040
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:51.250
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.590
Let's have a fight!

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.300
1: Once the battle's done

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.130
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:01.470
On 3, let's be friends!

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:08.140
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:13.480
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.980
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:20.110
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.910
I choose you!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:30.920
I Am Metamon!

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.420
I swear, those guys...

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:38.910
Don’t they know
how to treat a star actress?!

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.790
They should be nicer
to their fans, too, meow.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.970
I’m just glad they didn’t
call Miss Junsa.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:48.900
Metamon! Where are you?!

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.140
Metamon!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:55.790
H-Hey! W-What?!

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.450
What’s up, Musashi?

00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.930
Just my imagination?

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.830
Our Metamon...

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:09.420
...used to be famous for transforming so accurately that
it was more real than the real Pokémon.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:12.140
Well, I get why it’d want to run.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.050
Director Koreda was
pretty intense...

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:16.600
Yes...

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.750
But he’s only that strict...

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.500
...because he’s taken
Metamon under his wing.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:28.010
Director Koreda was the one who decided
to hire a no-name Metamon in the first place.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.720
I see...

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.870
This work will be
Metamon’s big break!

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.270
We have to get it back, quickly!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.400
Um... I’ll help!

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:37.630
Me, too!

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:38.910
Thank you.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.870
Then let’s split up.

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:44.860
What’s this?

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.590
The Metamon from earlier?

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.870
What’s it doing here, meow?

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.330
Wait, you ran away, meow?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:55.970
You did get scolded pretty bad...
Did they fire you?

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.670
That’s still no reason to follow <i>us.</i>

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.890
How about we make this Metamon
our partner, meow?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:06.010
Metamon can become anything!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.800
I’m sure it’d be
a great asset, meow!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.730
Now that you mention it...

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.510
It might expand our possibilities
for schemes.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:18.070
If you’ve got nowhere else to go, then you should aim
to become the star of Team Rocket, meow!

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:22.400
Then show us a
proper transformation.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.400
Try to become an Absol
for starters, meow.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.500
Now try Glacia, meow!

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:48.260
Glacia isn’t that fat, meow...

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:52.180
Third time’s the charm!
Come forth, Bohmander!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.950
See, you can do it
if you try!

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:02.110
Wait, meow...

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.070
I can see why it’d get fired, meow...

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.840
Transforming’s the <i>only</i> thing
Metamon can do...

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.110
This is a pretty fatal flaw...

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.500
Moping won’t get you anywhere!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:27.050
If you call yourself an actress,
you’d better show some more guts!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:31.550
When a true actress goes on stage,
she’s gotta deliver a real killing performance!

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.870
Her actress switch
has been flipped...

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:36.560
And she’s entered
Mentor Mode, too, meow...

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.100
That’s what you need!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.030
All right!
I’ll give you some training!

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.110
Spare me the dumb questions.
Just come with me!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:53.240
If you wanna get good,
you gotta keep on trying.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:59.500
That said, it’s time to enact Operation
“Play Magicians and Steal Pokémon”!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.780
What happened to
the actress training?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.380
Dunno...

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.000
We’ll do a teleportation trick!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.840
Here we have a blue box
and a red box.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:14.360
We’ll put a Pokémon from the audience
into this blue box.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:17.640
Then at the count of three...

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.270
Oh, how strange!

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:26.270
“The audience’s Pokémon magically pops out
from the red box instead!”, get it?

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.770
Did it teleport?!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:29.960
Of course not.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.780
The audience Pokémon stays
in the blue box.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:37.660
The red box contains Metamon,
who’s transformed into a flawless copy!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.970
Switch the audience Pokémon
with Metamon...

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:43.960
Then we can steal the Pokémon
without raising suspicion, meow!

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.210
Hang on. What happens
with Metamon, then?

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:50.250
It can just come back to us
on its own!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.550
Team Rocket members
gotta be able to run fast, you know!

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.650
So...

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:59.380
Hello!
We’re street magicians!

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:03.390
We’ll make your Pokémon teleport!

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.120
Wow, that sounds fun!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:11.750
This box does not have
any tricks or trickery in it.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:16.020
And once I finish counting,
Eevee will move over to that box!

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:19.450
Now, one, two, three!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.030
See?

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.120
It’s gone?!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.360
Oh, no, don’t you worry.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.890
It’s right here in the red box!

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.500
Whoa, that’s...

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.510
...<i>not</i> incredible.

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.790
This isn’t my Eevee!

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.830
Huh? How weird, meow.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.820
Hey, where’d my Eevee go?!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:38.650
Ta-daah!

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:39.990
Teleportation!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.010
Seriously?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.790
Come on, Eevee.

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.520
Operation failed, meow...

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.650
Keep on trying!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.650
On to the next one!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.280
We’re street magicians!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.910
Who’s that?!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.530
Your Pokémon will...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.660
That isn’t my Pokémon!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.410
...teleport!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.540
Not mine!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.570
<i>We’re performing magic tricks!</i>

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.320
<i>All</i> of them failed, meow...

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:19.490
We nearly had it
with that Wooper, though.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:22.930
Because their faces were
similar to begin with, meow.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.940
What good actress
can’t take a hit?

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.940
If you fail,
just try a different approach!

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.930
We’re partners, right?

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.330
You...

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.840
You <i>can</i> do it!

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:44.080
Amazing, meow!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.500
PocketMonsters

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.340
Pocket Monsters!
PocketMonsters

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:54.630
PocketMonsters

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:59.550
. Normal .
Metamon
PocketMonsters

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.570
No good, huh?

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.730
How strange.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.780
You got it perfectly before.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.990
What’s up?

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.940
Maybe I was just seeing things, but...

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:29.500
I feel like you were less tense right here
when you pulled it off...

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.300
If it managed to transform
when it was less tense...

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.210
Does that mean being nervous
prevents it from doing it right?

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:40.180
Pressure can often
make you freeze up, meow.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:43.020
What do you when you’re nervous?

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:46.700
I don’t even know the <i>meaning</i>
of the word “nervous”!

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.640
I was a fool for asking...

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.310
I wash my face, meow!

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:52.720
You?

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:55.730
I sniff my own socks!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.630
What?

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.190
You’ve been doing <i>that?</i>

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.700
T-The point is, everyone has
their own approach!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:06.940
So Metamon just needs
some way to calm down!

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:08.160
I get it, meow.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:13.520
How about you psyche yourself up
with a nice, strong slap?!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.630
That’s a real good motivator!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.260
Give it a try, meow!

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:25.630
Good! You can do it!

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:27.180
Turn into Nyarth!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.140
So close, meow...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.520
But that looked great
for a second!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:40.280
Keep it up until you’ve got
a firm grasp on success! Again!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:47.830
What a great feeling, meow!
All right! Now try Sonansu!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.140
Good!

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:55.710
Keep up the pace!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:04.470
Metamon!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.020
Okay! See, you can do it!

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:11.270
You got it sorted!
Feels great, right?

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.600
I always believed in you!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.340
With Metamon by our side,
we’re unbeatable!

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:21.230
It can turn into a big Pokémon
and give us a ride!

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.740
Or into a strong Pokémon
and protect us!

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:29.990
Since it can become <i>any</i> Pokémon,
tailing and infiltration will be a breeze, meow!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:37.770
I’m picturing a bright future
where we storm our way up the ranks!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:40.450
I see Sakaki praising me, meow!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.590
With Metamon on our side,

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:45.410
we are now...

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.640
<i>Super Team Rocket!</i>

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.530
Well then let’s start by...

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:52.280
...finally catching
the brat boy’s Pikachu!

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.420
We’re counting on you,
Metamon!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.910
I can’t believe we still
haven’t found any trace of it...

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:00.560
Where could it have gone?

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:05.110
You two look down.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.180
You should cheer
yourselves up...

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:11.660
...by watching our magic show!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:17.340
We’re gonna do a super magic trick;
teleporting your Pokémon, meow!

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:21.370
You wanna try, Pikachu?

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:23.690
All right...

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:27.550
You go in this box,
little Pikachu.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.550
There are no tricks
or trickery here.

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:35.000
Now, one, two, three!

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.390
Amazing!
How did they do that?

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:42.650
Here’s your Pikachu back.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:44.640
Hang on...

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:50.160
Is this really my Pikachu?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.530
It’s gotta be, yeah?

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.950
No... That’s not Pikachu!

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.710
Where is Pikachu?!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:05.050
If you ask us “Where is Pikachu?!...

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.400
We’ll answer out of
sympathy for the world!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.960
To protect the world from devastation.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.390
To preserve world peace.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:18.420
Championing the evils
of truth and love.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:21.010
We’re the lovely, charming villains.

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:22.460
Musashi!

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:23.650
Kojiro!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:27.430
The Super Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:30.740
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.780
Just kidding, meow!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.440
Team Rocket!

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.580
That Metamon...

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:46.350
Great, isn’t it?
It’s our highly promising new member!

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:48.420
Pikachu is ours!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:50.670
Pikachu!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.510
Rabbifoot, stop them!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.260
Metamon!
Transform into a Bohmander!

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:58.270
Metamon!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.910
There you are!

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:00.890
Miss Manager!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:05.270
Hey! I don’t care if you’re a manager or whatever...
Stay out of our way!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:09.530
That’s <i>my</i> line! That Metamon is
an actress with a promising future!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:13.100
Let’s go home, Metamon.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.780
Director Koreda is
waiting for you, too.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:18.280
He said only you
can play that part.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:20.540
If you’re not there,
we won’t get anywhere!

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:23.420
It didn’t get fired?

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:24.460
Metamon!

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.860
Metamon!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.670
Meta—

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.000
Oh, no!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.370
Pikachu’s loose!

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.680
Well, for now, let’s... scram!

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:41.120
Wait!

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.880
You’re not
getting away!

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.660
We managed to lose them...

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:49.110
They chased us
all over the place, meow...

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.390
Now, then...

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:57.750
We were so panicked that we just
brought Metamon with us, but... what now?

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.210
Yeah...

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.310
Guess we have no choice.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.440
Musashi?

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.960
Kojiro! Nyarth!

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.980
Team Rocket’s putting on
the performance of a lifetime!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.740
So Team Rocket kidnapped Metamon
and forced it to follow their orders...

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:41.990
And now they’re demanding a ransom...
What a bunch of monsters!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.290
Metamon... Why?

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:49.380
I see you brought the money,
as ordered...

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:51.380
Where are you?!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.960
Right here.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.930
Metamon!

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.300
Stop!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:01.180
Save the touching reunion
for later.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:05.310
If you want your Metamon back,
then hand over the money!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.330
That’s low, Team Rocket!

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:13.070
Who... do you think
you’re dealing with?

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:19.990
A ruthless army of villains
who’ll gladly trample love and friendship for our goals...

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:24.000
That’s us,
Super Team Rocket, meow!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.580
Got it?
Then fork over the cash!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.630
Starting today,
we’ll be living like royalty!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.400
We’ll be swimming
in money, meow!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.510
They’re so infuriating!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:41.210
You wait there.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.450
You brats have
nothing to do with this. Get lost!

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:46.470
Yeah!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.390
Money, please!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.690
Pikachu, we’re getting Metamon back!

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.640
Us, too, Rabbifoot!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.450
Hit them with an Em—

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:56.650
H-Hey!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.490
Sonansu, do your thing!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:08.330
That didn’t do a thing!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.580
That barely even tickled!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.410
If you wanna beat us,

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:17.580
you’d <i>at least</i> need to hit us
with 100,000 Volts!

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.680
Yeah! Like, <i>kaboom!</i>

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:25.430
You’re so dense!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.690
We told you to use 100,000 Volts!
<i>Catch on,</i> already!

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:31.810
Not that there’s any guarantee
it’ll hurt us at all!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:35.700
We’re not the least bit scared
of your 100,000 Volts, meow!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.820
<i>Hey, hey! Come on!</i>

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.700
What’s their problem?!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:43.280
I don’t know, but if you insist!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.750
<i>All right!</i>

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:46.830
Go, Pikachu!
100,000 Volts!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.620
Yeah!

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:58.030
What a great... I mean...

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:00.930
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.120
It’s all right now.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.600
Oh, Metamon...

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.120
100,000 Volts sure does sting...

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.440
But that was some great acting
back there, Musashi.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:33.820
Yeah. It was the best!

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:36.250
Who do you think
you’re talking to?

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.410
I’m a star actress!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.520
An actress with
a promising future, huh?

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:48.260
You can do it, Metamon.

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:52.190
It’s time to get started!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.900
This isn’t it!

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:55.900
No! No! Not good enough!

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:01.830
Slap!

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:13.540
Ready... Action!

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:27.180
Cut!

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:30.310
Yes... Oh, yes!

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:32.140
That’s <i>it!</i>
The footage I wanted!

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.160
Team Rocket and Metamon...

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:38.570
They may have parted ways,
but the memory of their short time together...

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:42.110
...will surely stay
with Metamon forever.

